WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.678
Your earlier learning can help with the next decision

00:00:02.705 --> 00:00:06.231
From memory explain three distinctions you would check before

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:10.284
saying everything is arranged Now compare with the earlier

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:16.297
idea Examples request versus approval access versus authority recommendation

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:21.323
versus decision named deputy versus accepted assignment business preference

00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:26.534
versus separate protective / service acceptance Explain the relevant

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.692
fact rather than simply listing the words This revisits

00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:35.639
an earlier idea after intervening activities It is practice

00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:40.547
not a controlled memory examination A later revisit is

00:00:40.586 --> 00:00:41.705
recorded separately
